# Public Apple trust anchors compiled into apple-codesign-quick. These are not
# developer certificates or signing identities; keep every other .cer ignored.
!SideNekoFull/rust-core/vendor/apple-codesign-quick/assets/AppleIncRootCertificate.cer
!SideNekoFull/rust-core/vendor/apple-codesign-quick/assets/AppleWWDRCAG3.cer
# Public Apple intermediate compiled into isideload; it is a trust certificate,
# not a developer signing identity.
!SideNekoFull/rust-core/vendor/isideload/src/assets/AppleWWDRCAG3.cer
# Synthetic, self-signed test archives used only by rust-core unit tests. Their
# TEST000000 identity and test key are fixtures, never real signing material.
!SideNekoFull/rust-core/testdata/p12/openssl.p12
!SideNekoFull/rust-core/testdata/p12/sidesign.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.pairing
adi.pb
